1
00:00:14,832 --> 00:00:21,068
Bonjour, madame. Après le cours, j'ai une question.
Hello, ma’am. After class, I have a question.

2
00:00:21,168 --> 00:00:26,684
Bonjour, Adrien. Oui, bien sûr.
Hello, Adrien. Yes, of course.

3
00:00:26,784 --> 00:00:29,564
Comment dit-on ce mot ?
How do you say this word?

4
00:00:29,664 --> 00:00:32,636
On dit « bonjour ».
You say “hello.”

5
00:00:32,736 --> 00:00:37,484
Merci. Et comment écrit-on ce mot ?
Thank you. And how do you spell this word?

6
00:00:37,584 --> 00:00:40,436
B-o-n-j-o-u-r.
B-o-n-j-o-u-r.

7
00:00:40,536 --> 00:00:43,244
Je ne comprends pas.
I don’t understand.

8
00:00:43,344 --> 00:00:46,196
Je peux répéter.
I can repeat.

9
00:00:46,296 --> 00:00:51,524
Merci beaucoup. Au revoir, madame.
Thank you very much. Goodbye, ma’am.
